{"seq":1,"slug":"groups-and-backreferences","title":"分组与反向引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/groups-and-backreferences","wordCount":729,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"分组与反向引用\">分组与反向引用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>圆括号 <code>()</code> 创建<strong>捕获分组</strong>，同时完成两件事：把多个元素组合为一个单元，并记住匹配到的文本供后续使用。若只需分组、不需引用，则用 <code>(?:...)</code> 非捕获分组；<strong>反向引用</strong> <code>\\1</code> 引用前面分组已匹配的<strong>具体文本</strong>（而非模式本身）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>捕获分组按左括号出现顺序从 1 编号，嵌套分组同样遵循此规则。</li>\n<li>引用分两种上下文：模式内用 <code>\\1</code>，替换字符串中用 <code>$1</code>。</li>\n<li>不需要引用结果时优先使用非捕获分组 <code>(?:...)</code>，减少编号负担与开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"捕获分组\">捕获分组</h2><p>圆括号 <code>()</code> 在正则表达式中创建<strong>捕获分组</strong>（Capturing Group），它同时完成两件事：将多个元素组合为一个单元，并记住匹配的文本以供后续使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const datePattern = /(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})/;&#10;const match = datePattern.exec(&#39;2026-04-01&#39;);&#10;match[0];&#10;match[1];&#10;match[2];&#10;match[3];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> datePattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)-(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datePattern.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">match[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>match[0]</code></td>\n<td>完整匹配</td>\n<td><code>&quot;2026-04-01&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>match[1]</code></td>\n<td>第一个捕获组</td>\n<td><code>&quot;2026&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>match[2]</code></td>\n<td>第二个捕获组</td>\n<td><code>&quot;04&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>match[3]</code></td>\n<td>第三个捕获组</td>\n<td><code>&quot;01&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>match.index</code></td>\n<td>匹配起始位置</td>\n<td><code>0</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PATTERN[&quot;/(\\\\d{4})-(\\\\d{2})-(\\\\d{2})/&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; G1[&quot;组1: \\\\d{4}&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; G2[&quot;组2: \\\\d{2}&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; G3[&quot;组3: \\\\d{2}&quot;]&#10;    G1 --&gt; V1[&quot;2026&quot;]&#10;    G2 --&gt; V2[&quot;04&quot;]&#10;    G3 --&gt; V3[&quot;01&quot;]\">graph LR\n    PATTERN[\"/(\\\\d{4})-(\\\\d{2})-(\\\\d{2})/\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; G1[\"组1: \\\\d{4}\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; G2[\"组2: \\\\d{2}\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; G3[\"组3: \\\\d{2}\"]\n    G1 --&gt; V1[\"2026\"]\n    G2 --&gt; V2[\"04\"]\n    G3 --&gt; V3[\"01\"]</pre><p>分组编号按左括号出现的顺序从 1 开始。嵌套分组同样遵循此规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const nested = /((a)(b(c)))/;&#10;const m = nested.exec(&#39;abc&#39;);&#10;m[1];&#10;m[2];&#10;m[3];&#10;m[4];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nested</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">((a)(b(c)))</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nested.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"非捕获分组\">非捕获分组</h2><p>当只需要分组功能而不需要捕获结果时，使用 <code>(?:...)</code> 创建<strong>非捕获分组</strong>，避免不必要的内存开销。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const protocol = /(?:https?|ftp):\\/\\//;&#10;protocol.test(&#39;https://example.com&#39;);&#10;&#10;const withCapture = /(https?|ftp):\\/\\//;&#10;const withoutCapture = /(?:https?|ftp):\\/\\//;&#10;&#10;withCapture.exec(&#39;https://example.com&#39;)[1];&#10;withoutCapture.exec(&#39;https://example.com&#39;)[1];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?:https</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">ftp):</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">protocol.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withCapture</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(https</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">ftp):</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withoutCapture</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(?:https</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">ftp):</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withCapture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">withoutCapture.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>捕获</th>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(abc)</code></td>\n<td>捕获分组</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>提取子匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(?:abc)</code></td>\n<td>非捕获分组</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>仅分组不捕获</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 在复杂正则中大量使用捕获分组会降低性能并让分组编号难以管理。原则是：如果后续不需要引用某个分组的匹配结果，就使用非捕获分组。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"反向引用\">反向引用</h2><p><strong>反向引用</strong>（Backreference）使用 <code>\\n</code> 语法引用前面第 n 个捕获分组已经匹配的<strong>具体文本</strong>（而非模式）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const repeated = /(\\w+)\\s+\\1/;&#10;repeated.test(&#39;hello hello&#39;);&#10;repeated.test(&#39;hello world&#39;);&#10;&#10;const xmlTag = /&lt;(\\w+)&gt;.*?&lt;\\/\\1&gt;/;&#10;xmlTag.test(&#39;&lt;div&gt;content&lt;/div&gt;&#39;);&#10;xmlTag.test(&#39;&lt;div&gt;content&lt;/span&gt;&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> repeated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+\\1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repeated.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repeated.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello world'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> xmlTag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">&#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xmlTag.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;div>content&#x3C;/div>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xmlTag.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;div>content&#x3C;/span>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 引擎&#10;    participant S as 字符串 &quot;hello hello&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: (\\\\w+) 匹配 &quot;hello&quot;,存入组1&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\s+ 匹配空格&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\1 回引组1,要求匹配 &quot;hello&quot;&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: 第二个 &quot;hello&quot; 匹配成功\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 引擎\n    participant S as 字符串 \"hello hello\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: (\\\\w+) 匹配 \"hello\",存入组1\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\s+ 匹配空格\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: \\\\1 回引组1,要求匹配 \"hello\"\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: 第二个 \"hello\" 匹配成功</pre><p>反向引用在替换中的应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const swapWords = /(\\w+)\\s+(\\w+)/;&#10;&#39;hello world&#39;.replace(swapWords, &#39;$2 $1&#39;);&#10;&#10;const doubleQuoteToSingle = /&quot;([^&quot;]*)&quot;/g;&#10;&#39;He said &quot;hello&quot;&#39;.replace(doubleQuoteToSingle, &quot;&#39;$1&#39;&quot;);&#10;&#10;const removeDuplicates = /\\b(\\w+)\\s+\\1\\b/g;&#10;&#39;the the quick brown fox fox&#39;.replace(removeDuplicates, &#39;$1&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> swapWords</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello world'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(swapWords, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$2 $1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> doubleQuoteToSingle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'He said \"hello\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doubleQuoteToSingle, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"'$1'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> removeDuplicates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+\\1\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'the the quick brown fox fox'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(removeDuplicates, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>上下文</th>\n<th>引用语法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模式内</td>\n<td><code>\\1</code></td>\n<td><code>/(\\w+)\\s+\\1/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换字符串</td>\n<td><code>$1</code></td>\n<td><code>str.replace(/(a)/, &#39;$1b&#39;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换函数</td>\n<td>参数</td>\n<td><code>str.replace(/(a)/, (_, g1) =&gt; g1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分组在字符串方法中的应用\">分组在字符串方法中的应用</h2><p>JavaScript 的字符串方法与正则分组深度集成，提供了强大的文本处理能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const log = &#39;2026-04-01 ERROR: Connection timeout&#39;;&#10;const parts = log.match(/^(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})\\s+(\\w+):\\s+(.+)$/);&#10;parts[1];&#10;parts[2];&#10;parts[3];&#10;&#10;const csv = &#39;name,age,city&#39;;&#10;csv.split(/(,)/);&#10;&#10;const template = &#39;Hello {{name}}, welcome to {{city}}&#39;;&#10;const data = { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, city: &#39;Shanghai&#39; };&#10;template.replace(/\\{\\{(\\w+)\\}\\}/g, (_, key) =&gt; data[key]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-04-01 ERROR: Connection timeout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">):</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parts[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parts[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parts[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> csv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'name,age,city'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">csv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(,)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Hello {{name}}, welcome to {{city}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, city: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Shanghai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\{\\{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\}\\}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data[key]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    METHODS[&quot;字符串方法&quot;] --&gt; MATCH[&quot;match()&quot;]&#10;    METHODS --&gt; REPLACE[&quot;replace()&quot;]&#10;    METHODS --&gt; SPLIT[&quot;split()&quot;]&#10;    METHODS --&gt; MATCHALL[&quot;matchAll()&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt; M1[&quot;返回分组数组&quot;]&#10;    REPLACE --&gt; R1[&quot;$1 $2 引用分组&quot;]&#10;    SPLIT --&gt; S1[&quot;捕获分组保留分隔符&quot;]&#10;    MATCHALL --&gt; MA1[&quot;迭代所有匹配+分组&quot;]\">graph TD\n    METHODS[\"字符串方法\"] --&gt; MATCH[\"match()\"]\n    METHODS --&gt; REPLACE[\"replace()\"]\n    METHODS --&gt; SPLIT[\"split()\"]\n    METHODS --&gt; MATCHALL[\"matchAll()\"]\n    MATCH --&gt; M1[\"返回分组数组\"]\n    REPLACE --&gt; R1[\"$1 $2 引用分组\"]\n    SPLIT --&gt; S1[\"捕获分组保留分隔符\"]\n    MATCHALL --&gt; MA1[\"迭代所有匹配+分组\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> <code>String.prototype.matchAll()</code> 返回一个迭代器，包含每次匹配的完整信息（包括所有捕获组和索引），是处理多次匹配的现代首选方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((分组与反向引用))&#10;    捕获分组&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;&amp;#41;&quot; 语法&#10;      自动编号&#10;      嵌套按左括号排序&#10;    非捕获分组&#10;      &quot;&amp;#40;?:&amp;#41;&quot; 语法&#10;      无编号无捕获&#10;      性能更优&#10;    反向引用&#10;      &quot;\\\\1 模式内引用&quot;&#10;      &quot;$1 替换引用&quot;&#10;      匹配具体文本&#10;    字符串集成&#10;      match 提取&#10;      replace 替换&#10;      matchAll 迭代&#10;      split 保留分隔\">mindmap\n  root((分组与反向引用))\n    捕获分组\n      \"&amp;#40;&amp;#41;\" 语法\n      自动编号\n      嵌套按左括号排序\n    非捕获分组\n      \"&amp;#40;?:&amp;#41;\" 语法\n      无编号无捕获\n      性能更优\n    反向引用\n      \"\\\\1 模式内引用\"\n      \"$1 替换引用\"\n      匹配具体文本\n    字符串集成\n      match 提取\n      replace 替换\n      matchAll 迭代\n      split 保留分隔</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>捕获分组</strong> <code>()</code> 组合元素并记住匹配内容，编号按左括号出现顺序从 1 开始。</li>\n<li><strong>非捕获分组</strong> <code>(?:...)</code> 仅提供分组功能，不占用编号，适合不需要引用的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>反向引用</strong> <code>\\1</code> 在模式中引用已捕获的具体文本，<code>$1</code> 在替换字符串中引用。</li>\n<li>JavaScript 的 <code>match</code>、<code>replace</code>、<code>matchAll</code>、<code>split</code> 方法都与分组深度集成。</li>\n<li>优先使用非捕获分组，仅在需要提取或反向引用时使用捕获分组。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分组与反向引用","id":"分组与反向引用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"捕获分组","id":"捕获分组"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"非捕获分组","id":"非捕获分组"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"反向引用","id":"反向引用"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"分组在字符串方法中的应用","id":"分组在字符串方法中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"锚点与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-fundamentals/anchors-and-boundaries"},"next":{"title":"前瞻与后顾断言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/advanced-patterns/lookahead-and-lookbehind"}}